## Decision proof

The registry exposes primary-plus-fallback candidates through `Seat.Invocations()`. Neither validation nor enumeration inspects ambient environment variables or chooses a candidate automatically. The canonical Opus fallback is executable by the arriving CLI consumer, while retry policy and selected-harness evidence remain consumer responsibilities.
